        78.36999999999999,
        13.189999999999998
      ],
      "text" : "Pulse Oximeters"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        305.51050000000004,
        237.01400000000007,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "A pulse oximeter is a device that measures the amount of"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        293.01050000000004,
        237.01999999999992,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "oxygen in an individual’s blood, in addition to heart rate."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        280.51050000000004,
        237.01999999999998,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "This non-invasive device measures the color changes that"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        268.01050000000004,
        237.00199999999995,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "red blood cells undergo when they become saturated with"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        255.51050000000004,
        237.12999999999994,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "oxygen. By transmitting a special light beam through a"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        243.01050000000004,
        237.12900000000013,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "fingertip to evaluate the color of the red cells, a pulse"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        230.51050000000004,
        236.84600000000012,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "oximeter can calculate the degree of oxygen saturation"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        218.01050000000004,
        236.96000000000015,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "within one percent of directly measured blood oxygen."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        205.51050000000004,
        236.99499999999989,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "Because of their portability and speed, pulse oximeters are"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        193.01050000000004,
        237.02299999999985,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "very useful for pilots operating in nonpressurized aircraft"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        180.51050000000004,
        237.00800000000004,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "above 12,500 feet where supplemental oxygen is required."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        168.01050000000004,
        236.98799999999994,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "A pulse oximeter permits crewmembers and passengers of"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        155.51050000000004,
        237.13499999999988,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "an aircraft to evaluate their actual need for supplemental"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        143.01050000000004,
        90.269999999999996,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "oxygen. [Figure 7-47]"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        117.44050000000004,
        140.61000000000007,
        13.189999999999998
      ],
      "text" : "Servicing of Oxygen Systems"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        105.01050000000004,
        236.98000000000013,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "Before servicing any aircraft with oxygen, consult the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        92.510500000000036,
        237.1550000000002,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "specific aircraft service manual to determine the type of"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        80.010500000000036,
        236.95000000000016,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "equipment required and procedures to be used. Certain"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        72.000000000000014,
        67.510500000000036,
        237.01299999999992,
        11.469999999999999
      ],
      "text" : "precautions should be observed whenever aircraft oxygen"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        384.72050000000002,
        237.00899999999996,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "systems are to be serviced. Oxygen system servicing should"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        372.22050000000002,
        236.99499999999995,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "be accomplished only when the aircraft is located outside"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        359.72050000000002,
        237.00999999999993,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "of the hangars. Personal cleanliness and good housekeeping"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        347.22050000000002,
        237.00100000000003,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "are imperative when working with oxygen. Oxygen under"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        334.72050000000002,
        236.85999999999996,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "pressure creates spontaneous results when brought in contact"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        322.22050000000002,
        236.88000000000005,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "with petroleum products. Service people should be certain to"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        309.72050000000002,
        237.00600000000003,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "wash dirt, oil, and grease (including lip salves and hair oil)"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        297.22050000000002,
        237.11000000000007,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "from their hands before working around oxygen equipment. It"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        321.00000000000006,
        284.72050000000002,
        237.01799999999986,
        11.470000000000027
      ],
      "text" : "is also essential that clothing and tools are free of oil, grease,"
    }
